msgid ":c:macro:`PyObject_GC_New`"
msgstr ":c:macro:`PyObject_GC_New`"

#: ../../c-api/allocation.rst:89 ../../c-api/allocation.rst:139
msgid ":c:func:`PyType_GenericAlloc`"
msgstr ":c:func:`PyType_GenericAlloc`"

#: ../../c-api/allocation.rst:90 ../../c-api/allocation.rst:140
msgid ":c:member:`~PyTypeObject.tp_alloc`"
msgstr ":c:member:`~PyTypeObject.tp_alloc`"

#: ../../c-api/allocation.rst:95
msgid "Like :c:macro:`PyObject_New` except:"
msgstr "Podobné jako :c:macro:`PyObject_New` kromě:"

#: ../../c-api/allocation.rst:97
msgid ""
"It allocates enough memory for the *TYPE* structure plus *size* "
"(``Py_ssize_t``) fields of the size given by the "
":c:member:`~PyTypeObject.tp_itemsize` field of *typeobj*."
msgstr ""
"Alokuje dostatek paměti pro strukturu *TYPE* plus *size* (``Py_ssize_t``) "
"polí o velikosti dané polem :c:member:`~PyTypeObject.tp_itemsize` objektu "
"*typeobj*."

#: ../../c-api/allocation.rst:100
msgid "The memory is initialized like :c:func:`PyObject_InitVar`."
msgstr "Paměť je inicializována podobně jako :c:func:`PyObject_InitVar`."

#: ../../c-api/allocation.rst:102
msgid ""
"This is useful for implementing objects like tuples, which are able to "
"determine their size at construction time.  Embedding the array of fields "
"into the same allocation decreases the number of allocations, improving the "
"memory management efficiency."
msgstr ""
"Toto je užitečné pro implementaci objektů jako jsou tuple, které jsou "
"schopny určit svou velikost v době konstrukce. Vložení pole polí do stejné "
"alokace snižuje počet alokací, což zlepšuje efektivitu správy paměti."

#: ../../c-api/allocation.rst:114
msgid ""
"This cannot be used for objects with :c:macro:`Py_TPFLAGS_HAVE_GC` set in "
":c:member:`~PyTypeObject.tp_flags`; use :c:macro:`PyObject_GC_NewVar` "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"Toto nelze použít pro objekty s :c:macro:`Py_TPFLAGS_HAVE_GC` nastaveným v "
":c:member:`~PyTypeObject.tp_flags`; místo toho použijte "
":c:macro:`PyObject_GC_NewVar`."

#: ../../c-api/allocation.rst:118
msgid ""
"Memory allocated by this function must be freed with :c:func:`PyObject_Free`"
" (usually called via the object's :c:member:`~PyTypeObject.tp_free` slot)."
msgstr ""
"Paměť alokovaná touto funkcí musí být uvolněna pomocí "
":c:func:`PyObject_Free` (obvykle voláno přes slot "
":c:member:`~PyTypeObject.tp_free` objektu)."

#: ../../c-api/allocation.rst:133
msgid ""
"PyObject *list_instance = PyObject_CallNoArgs((PyObject *)&PyList_Type);"
msgstr ""
"PyObject *list_instance = PyObject_CallNoArgs((PyObject *)&PyList_Type);"

