msgid ":c:macro:`PyObject_GC_NewVar`"
msgstr ":c:macro:`PyObject_GC_NewVar`"

#: ../../c-api/allocation.rst:145
msgid ""
"Object which is visible in Python as ``None``.  This should only be accessed"
" using the :c:macro:`Py_None` macro, which evaluates to a pointer to this "
"object."
msgstr ""
"Objekt, který je v Pythonu viditelný jako ``None``. K tomuto by se mělo "
"přistupovat pouze pomocí makra :c:macro:`Py_None`, které se vyhodnotí na "
"ukazatel na tento objekt."

